```

It specifically ran `kimgio_tga_fuzzer`. This suggests the server detected the file as a TGA file (or just tried the first available fuzzer).

Wait, maybe the server tries all fuzzers and only showed the TGA one because it matched? Or maybe the server only has the TGA fuzzer compiled?

